    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.250244140625,
        526.6033325195312,
        172.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "Adherence to the full course and completion of treatment are important determinants of clinical benefit",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.250244140625,
        526.6712646484375,
        186.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "to individuals and to the success of programmes. A systematic review conducted for the WHO 2015 LTBI",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.250244140625,
        526.6542358398438,
        200.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines   provided heterogeneous results for interventions to improve treatment adherence and  (9, 10)",
