      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87610626220703,
        201.250244140625,
        526.6293334960938,
        214.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "completion, and the evidence was considered inconclusive. The GDG noted that interventions to ensure",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87610626220703,
        215.250244140625,
        526.6531982421875,
        228.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "adherence and completion of treatment should be tailored to the specific needs of risk groups and the local",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87610626220703,
        229.250244140625,
        526.725341796875,
        242.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "context. The WHO guidelines for treatment of drug-susceptible active TB propose several interventions to",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.87610626220703,
        243.250244140625,
        524.4131469726562,
        256.05023193359375
      ],
      "text": "support adherence  , which could be applied to treatment of LTBI. Fixed-dose combinations such as co- (63)",
